# Replica of a trade listing (2026-11-18): Royal Plate ilvl 87, Hunter/Warlord, 6-link:
#   elevated Warlord mana-cost/ignore-stuns, T1 (not elevated) Hunter attack crit (+1.14%),
#   additional Curse, low-tier armour/stun hybrid prefix, bench (56-74)% armour, T6 fire res.
# Cheaper route: the Hunter piece only needs T1 attack crit as its ONLY influenced mod
# (no Dominance on it): a magic Hunter plate with just that suffix.
include "lib/endgame_chest_parts.craft"

warlord_piece_lean()
buy "Astral Plate" ilvl 84 influence hunter for price "base:astral_plate_hunter_84"
transmute
until has "Hunter: attack crit" tier <= 1 and influenced_count == 1 { alt }
set_aside hunter
merge_blind()
curse_reforge()
fill_prefixes()
finish()

goal has "Warlord: mana cost" elevated and has "Hunter: attack crit" tier <= 1 and has "Hunter: additional curse"
sell 0 chaos
